  "content_html": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/cba2db2145b4d2de4c.jpg\"><img alt=\"כיסא, ארון, שולחן, מנורה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"400\" data-original-width=\"433\" height=\"296\" src=\"/assets/images/content/cba2db2145b4d2de4c.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div></div><div><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">יוצא דופן</span></h2></div><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">איזה מבין 4 הפריטים בתמונה הנ\"ל הנו יוצא דופן (עפ\"י הפרשה)?</span></p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">תמונה טמונה</span></h2></div><p style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">1. לאיזה <b><u>פריט</u></b> המוזכר בפרשה, מרמז צמד הסמלים הבא?</span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/273497ae0da4cbe10b.webp\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><img alt=\"אבנים\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"64\" data-original-width=\"64\" src=\"/assets/images/content/273497ae0da4cbe10b.webp\" /></span></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/a1a6a6ae8490a8fe25.webp\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><img alt=\"חייל\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"64\" data-original-width=\"64\" src=\"/assets/images/content/a1a6a6ae8490a8fe25.webp\" /></span></a></div></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">2. לאיזה </span><b style=\"font-family: arial;\"><u>פריט</u></b><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"> המוזכר בפרשה, מרמז צמד הסמלים הבא?</span></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/c63d170db03e3130ee.webp\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><img alt=\"לחם\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"64\" data-original-width=\"64\" src=\"/assets/images/content/c63d170db03e3130ee.webp\" /></span></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/c63d170db03e3130ee.webp\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a></span></div><a href=\"/assets/images/content/2744c6ab3e2ad7a865.webp\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><img alt=\"פרצוף\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"64\" data-original-width=\"64\" src=\"/assets/images/content/2744c6ab3e2ad7a865.webp\" /></span></a></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">3. לאיזה <b><u>ביטוי</u></b> המוזכר בפרשה, מרמז צמד הסמלים הבא?</span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/df878694e641463585.webp\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><img alt=\"כפתור\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"64\" data-original-width=\"64\" src=\"/assets/images/content/df878694e641463585.webp\" /></span></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/1e317e1f753b3c1a89.webp\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><img alt=\"פרח\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"64\" data-original-width=\"64\" src=\"/assets/images/content/1e317e1f753b3c1a89.webp\" /></span></a></div><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">פתגם פגום</span></h2></div><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תקנו את הביטויים הבאים (מתוך הפרשה):</span></p><p></p><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בזה טורה</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">השקם אחת</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תועלת ישן</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">האש לא התאחו</span></li></ol><p></p><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><h2 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">מבחן אמריקאי</span></span></h2><div><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-size: medium;\">מה זה מִכְבָּר?</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-size: medium;\">עצום בגודלו</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-size: medium;\">מעטפת רשת</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-size: medium;\">בוא כבר</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-size: medium;\">עכבר זהב</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-size: medium;\">הגב שלו.</span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">מה זה&nbsp;</span>כַּפֹּרֶת?</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">כפרה</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">מסגרת</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">בסיס</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">כיסוי</span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">מה זה&nbsp;</span>כְּרֻבִים?</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">דמויות של תינוקות</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">קישוטים בצורת כרוב</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">קברים של כנעניים</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">מקלות כמו רובים</span></li></ol></ol></div></span></span></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מדרגאות</span></h2><h3 style=\"background-color: white; margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><p style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 מכשף/קוסם<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 השליך אבנים<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 הסתיים<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 צבע אדום (מהפרשה)\n</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 חוטים שזורים\n</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 אסף\n</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 דר</span></span></p></div></h3><h2 style=\"margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></span></h2><h3 style=\"margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"></h3><h3 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">יוצא דופן</span></span></h3><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">כיסא (במשכן היו ארון, שולחן ומנורה. לא היה כיסא)</span></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-weight: 400; text-align: right;\"><div></div></div><h3 style=\"margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"></h3><h3 style=\"margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"></h3><h3 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">תמונה טמונה</span></span></h3><div style=\"background-color: white; font-weight: 400; text-align: right;\"><ol style=\"font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">אבני מלואים</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">לחם הפנים</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">כפתור ופרח</span></span></li></ol><div></div></div><h3 style=\"margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"></h3><h3 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">פתגם פגום</span></span></h3><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: right;\"><ol><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">זהב טהור</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מקשה אחת</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">תולעת שני</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">אשה אל אחותה</span></span></li></ol></div><h3 style=\"margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"></h3><h3 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-deco